      "id": "claim_d5d94f4715ce428f81519ea7477a74fc",
      "statement": "parseMarks drops malformed entries rather than throwing; parseReviewMarks keeps only reviewer-number keys; mergeMarksList unions two sides by id (every mark survives, most-recent updatedAt wins on a tie-break to 'ours'), used for both pull merges and branch switches. Marks are deliberately not a field-level conflict because a highlight is a personal reading note, not the review record.",
