    {
      "id": "claim_581145a18951452d826adf0ecd38134f",
      "statement": "The FieldLinkPopover in Field.tsx is the only entry point for creating a mark-to-field link; a mark's own popover in PdfViewer only shows/unlinks, never adds. The popover shows already-linked marks (fixed to those linked before it opened) plus a picker ordered by orderMarksForLinking with search, and clicking a snippet jumps to the mark in the PDF without linking or closing.",
      "evidence": [
