      "statement": "A mark just created (lastCreatedMarkId) is offered once to the next field-link popover to open, auto-linking it instead of making the reviewer find it. It is narrowed by lastCreatedMarkAllowedField (any field right after creation; once a specific field is edited, only that field may claim it; anything else in between drops the offer to null) and consumed exactly once.",
