      "id": "claim_f7f80319869e432c8414030bf888ecc8",
      "statement": "PDF zoom lives in the Zustand store (pdfZoom, clamped 0.4-3) so keyboard shortcuts can drive it too; the page renders at fit-to-width base size scaled by the zoom factor. Ctrl/Cmd+wheel zooms via a native non-passive wheel listener (React's synthetic handler is passive by default and preventDefault would warn) instead of scrolling.",
