    {
      "id": "claim_92e1996f5efe4e4f8c0c6e2a26e233fb",
      "statement": "In-PDF search opens on Ctrl/Cmd+F, walks every rendered page's text layer with a TreeWalker building a Range per match (concatenating text nodes so matches can span pdf.js spans), debounces the query 150 ms, and tints matches via the CSS Custom Highlight API (CSS.highlights + Highlight) so it never mutates react-pdf's text-layer DOM, degrading gracefully when unavailable. The active match is centered in the scroll container.",
      "evidence": [
