    {
      "id": "claim_12abba4af28a440aae9092a1ccf37170",
      "statement": "captureSelection reads window.getSelection, NFC-normalizes the text (pdf.js's text layer can split an accented letter into adjacent spans), and stores it in pdfSelection; Field.tsx's grab-from-PDF button parses it as a number for number fields, a four-digit year for year fields, or raw text otherwise. A selection spanning a page boundary is split per page via splitRangeByPage with header/footer trimming on intermediate pages, and all fragments share a groupId.",
