      "id": "claim_cf7e7126f6b64adf9d5ba2fb2509f376",
      "statement": "Hovering an internal PDF link previews its destination by copying a crop from the destination page's already-rendered canvas (no extra pdf.js render). resolveLinkPreview resolves the destination, fits a crop box to the destination's own entry via detectEntryBox (a SumatraPDF DetectEntryBox port), copies it at full backing-store resolution and scales down only at display time, and flips above the link when cramped. linkHoverTokenRef invalidates any in-flight resolution when the hover ends.",
