    {
      "id": "claim_5252d411a77c49fcb3165d9393aa06e6",
      "statement": "pdfExport.ts is pure coordinate math kept separate from pdf-lib so it is trivially unit-testable. rectToPdfPoints converts a fraction-based MarkRect (top-left origin, y-down) to PDF user-space points (bottom-left origin, y-up) with the result's y being the rect's bottom edge (a /Rect lly). rectToQuadPoints produces the 8-number /QuadPoints array per PDF spec §8.4.5 (top-left, top-right, bottom-left, bottom-right — that pairing, not a clockwise walk, is what viewers expect). annotatedFileName derives paper.pdf -> paper-annotated.pdf without double-suffixing.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://src/model/pdfExport.ts#L1-L61",
