    {
      "id": "claim_87d0d33b664d44e486c4fdf1137ce055",
      "statement": "ExportPdfDialog resolves the current paper's PDF to an absolute path and offers two targets: save as a new PDF (native save picker, default annotated name) or overwrite the original (with a warning that it affects every reviewer sharing the file and likely causes a git conflict). Both call embedPdfAnnotations, which goes through the platform adapter to the Electron main process — the only place that touches both pdf-lib and Node fs.",
      "evidence": [
