    {
      "id": "claim_fed936ac6b0a4ba8b6337aa178f71f44",
      "statement": "In electron/main.ts embedMarksIntoPdf builds one annotation dictionary per mark by hand via pdf-lib's low-level PDFContext API (pdf-lib has no high-level add-Highlight helper): a Highlight annotation (with /QuadPoints per line, /CA 0.4 translucency, union /Rect) for highlights and a Text sticky-note annotation for notes, each with the comment as a PDFHexString (non-ASCII survives), color as a /C array, and T:'SaiLoR' as author. Annotations are appended to each page's existing /Annots so pre-existing annotations survive; a mark whose page is beyond the PDF's page count is skipped rather than failing the whole export.",
