    {
      "id": "claim_1b687ddf31d1400890254d19b284d475",
      "statement": "Reading position (paper, page, scroll offset as a fraction of the page's rendered height) is stored in localStorage keyed by the project's file path (slr.readingPosition.<path>), never in the shared project JSON where it would be diff noise. noteReadingPosition is debounced 500 ms from PdfViewer and takes paperId explicitly because the reviewer may have switched papers by the time the debounced call fires; it is a no-op with no stable save location. readOffsetFraction uses the same zoom-independent fraction convention as MarkRect.",
      "evidence": [
        {
