    {
      "id": "claim_bf1f1d84370340b089b195b0cf145d52",
      "statement": "On project load loadReadingPosition is used only if the named paper still exists, else it falls back to the first unfinished paper; the result populates session-only initialPdfPosition. PdfViewer consumes it once pages mount via a single combined scrollTop delta computed from the same rects scrollToMark uses, and re-snaps on every textRenderTick (each page's text layer finishing) because pages are still at loading-placeholder height when numPages first becomes known and earlier pages growing would otherwise push the target away. The request is dropped after a short idle window and discarded if the reviewer navigated to a different paper before it ran.",
