      "id": "claim_fc367d7959f948aa9d7f7e5719a257a6",
      "statement": "pdfMeta.ts best-effort extracts title/authors (embedded metadata first, validated by isPlausibleTitle, then a page-1 layout heuristic: largest text at top is the title, lines under it are authors parsed per-column) and abstract (always the layout heuristic abstractFromLines, which follows the column the 'Abstract' heading sits in via Segment.x because a two-column paper's left/right columns arrive on the same baseline). Extracted abstracts are length-bounded and flagged as unverified; extractPdfMeta never throws, returning {} when unsure.",
